23
00:03:21,855 --> 00:03:29,343
[Host] When she was born, the baby was about one hundred twenty centimeters long, and weighed about twenty kilograms.

24
00:03:29,943 --> 00:03:32,247
[Vocab] 体重

25
00:03:32,647 --> 00:03:34,424
[Host] It means body weight.

26
00:03:35,024 --> 00:03:45,872
[Slow] そして、生まれてから約一か月の8月10日、赤ちゃんの一般公開が始まりました。

27
00:03:46,671 --> 00:03:50,848
[Host] And from August tenth, the baby went on public display.

28
00:03:51,448 --> 00:03:54,448
