29
00:03:54,848 --> 00:04:00,104
[Host] It means opening something to the general public, so that everyone can come and see it.

30
00:04:00,704 --> 00:04:10,015
[Slow] お客さんは、プールの水の中が見える窓から、赤ちゃんを見ることができます。

31
00:04:10,816 --> 00:04:15,472
[Host] Visitors can watch the baby through a window that looks into the water of the pool.

32
